      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i dont even exist anymore. like i'm just a ghost moving through this house doing chores and fixing things and making sure everyone else is okay. i look in the mirror and i dont even recognize the person looking back. it's just... heavy. it never stops. i just want to breathe again but i feel like i'm underwater constantly.",
