      "content": "the \"small moments\" dont really matter though. they just feel like tiny distractions before the walls close in again. i'm not looking for a hobby or a break, i'm looking for peace. i just want the noise to stop. i want to finally be able to just... let go of all this responsibility. it feels like if i could just stop being \"me,\" everything would be easier for everyone.",
